<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The main objective of this project was to create a mentorship program that encourages high school girls to pursue careers in STEM fields \(Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics\). Through interactive workshops, hands-on learning, and guidance from professional female mentors, the program aimed to inspire, empower, and provide participants with foundational knowledge in data science, programming, and basic artificial intelligence.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
