<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (The bootcamp ran for five weeks and offered a mix of workshops, mentoring, and personalized guidance. Each Saturday, participants joined live virtual sessions focused on one of four STEM areas: Technology, Mathematics, Science, and Engineering. Every area was led by a pair of professional female mentors, supported by volunteers.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
